{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/33024957541461ff2de99c6e39e23656.avif?t=1764679570\" width=930 height=296 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combine management with mayhem in your quest to become the greatest tavern keeper in all of Meadgard. Battle mythological creatures by day and serve rowdy customers by night \u2014 and prepare to host the grandest feast Valhalla has ever seen!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Your Tavern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your customers and manage everything from thieving goblins, Norse gods and raging guests. Cook up delicious dishes, play some fine tunes and let the mead flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/858cd2cb106b4c07fccf97248d3c5b6b.poster.avif?t=1764679570\" width=790 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/858cd2cb106b4c07fccf97248d3c5b6b.webm?t=1764679570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the North</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture into the treacherous Nordic forests of Meadgard as you hunt for ingredients and resources. Defeat mythical beasts, clash with rival Vikings, uncover hidden treasures, navigate cunning traps and - most importantly - survive and bring your loot back home!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/b7ae9458dea5d829f84c281a5f70a79b.poster.avif?t=1764679570\" width=790 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/b7ae9458dea5d829f84c281a5f70a79b.webm?t=1764679570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Your Own</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back, relax and spend your hard-earned coins and resources in the village. A quirky cast of shopkeepers are eager to help you craft wacky new weapons, brew potions, grow your own crops and deck out your tavern with customizations to make it truly yours. Stock up, gear up, and get ready for the next big adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/54f3f83aeb5b90f909d1a2bd315058c4.poster.avif?t=1764679570\" width=790 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/54f3f83aeb5b90f909d1a2bd315058c4.webm?t=1764679570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/6d22234e448928004a92fe2d0979b567.avif?t=1764679570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras_big/6d22234e448928004a92fe2d0979b567.avif?t=1764679570 width=800 height=734 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433560?t=1764679570","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764679570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass