ue cast of villagers, and battle creatures and enemies as you explore the island for rare ingredients. Team up, discover new recipes, and prove your worth to the Norse gods!","steam_appid":2433560,"support_info":{"email":"info@oddiko.com","url":"https://www.oddiko.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Swedish","type":"game","website":null}